          "n/a": "Not applicable, with the reason recorded.",
          "0": "Insufficient supplied information to rate; does not establish inadequate quality.",
          "1": "Inadequate on the evidence supplied.",
          "2": "Adequate.",
          "3": "Good.",
          "4": "Excellent."
        },
        "rating_policy": "Section summaries use judgement, not averages. Human sample sizes are not treated as AI reliability or validity samples. No aggregate benchmark-quality score is calculated.",
